	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"「機動戦士Ｚガンダム」に登場するモビルスーツ「百式」がマスターグレードで登場。",
			"特徴的な全身の金色をゴールドメッキで再現。パーツの切り口が目立たないアンダーゲートを採用。",
			"武器にはビームライフル、クレイバズーカ，ビームサーベルが付属。",
			"脚部のシリンダーの可動ギミックも可動式で再現しています。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The mobile suit \"Hyaku Shiki\" that appears in \"Mobile Suit Z Gundam\" is now available in master grade.",
			"The characteristic golden color of the whole body is reproduced with gold plating. Adopts an under gate where the cut edges of the parts are not noticeable.",
			"Weapons include a beam rifle, clay bazooka, and beam saber.",
			"The movable gimmick of the cylinder on the leg is also reproduced in a movable type."
		]
	},
